msgid "Just Share"
msgstr "Just Share"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: just-share.php
msgid "https://github.com/ivanusto/just-share"
msgstr ""

#. Description of the plugin
#: just-share.php
msgid "Share buttons and related posts that ad blockers leave alone: plain server-rendered links through a same-site redirect, inline SVG icons, no third-party requests, no tracking."
msgstr "不會被擋廣告套件藏起來的分享按鈕與延伸閱讀：由伺服器輸出的純連結，經本站轉址，使用內嵌 SVG 圖示，不向第三方發出請求，也不追蹤。"

#. Author of the plugin
#: just-share.php
msgid "Ivan Lin"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin.php:35
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "設定"

#: includes/admin.php:53
msgid "Buttons are plain links that go through this site, so ad blockers do not hide them. No third-party scripts are loaded."
msgstr "按鈕都是經本站轉址的純連結，因此不會被擋廣告套件藏起來。不會載入任何第三方指令碼。"

#: includes/admin.php:58
msgid "Buttons"
msgstr "按鈕"

#: includes/admin.php:67
msgid "\"More options\" opens the system share sheet and only appears on devices that support it."
msgstr "「更多選項」會開啟系統的分享選單，只在支援的裝置上顯示。"

